{'symbol': 'MU', 'date': '2022-11-16 08:52:00', 'title': 'MICRON ANNOUNCES FURTHER ACTIONS TO\xa0ADDRESS MARKET CONDITIONS', 'text': 'BOISE, IDAHO, NOV. 16, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MICRON TECHNOLOGY, INC. (NASDAQ: MU), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IN RESPONSE TO MARKET CONDITIONS, THE COMPANY IS REDUCING DRAM AND NAND WAFER STARTS BY APPROXIMATELY 20% VERSUS FISCAL FOURTH QUARTER 2022. THESE REDUCTIONS WILL BE MADE ACROSS ALL TECHNOLOGY NODES WHERE MICRON HAS MEANINGFUL OUTPUT. MICRON IS ALSO WORKING TOWARD ADDITIONAL CAPEX CUTS. IN CALENDAR 2023, MICRON NOW EXPECTS ITS YEAR-ON-YEAR BIT SUPPLY GROWTH TO BE NEGATIVE FOR DRAM, AND IN THE SINGLE-DIGIT PERCENTAGE RANGE FOR NAND.'}